## Why This Is Asked
Assesses real-world ability to design private multi-tenant AI workloads on Azure with strong isolation, private services, and end-to-end observability.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant isolation via namespaces, RBAC, and Key Vault secrets
- Private endpoints for Azure ML and private AKS networking
- Istio routing, gateway design, per-tenant inference paths
- End-to-end observability with OpenTelemetry to Application Insights
- Drift detection, retraining pipelines, and cost-aware autoscaling

